  data: {
    LLM: "Identify the 'Power Suits' on the table. If you see the Ace of Hearts on the table, immediately start collecting Hearts.\n\nThe 'Stop' Timing: Don't wait for 51. If you hit 45 or 48 early in the game, call 'Stop' immediately. Your opponents will likely have fragmented hands and won't be able to catch up in a single turn.\n\nMarket Manipulation: If you have a card that an opponent clearly needs (e.g., they are swapping for Spades and you hold the Spade King), keep it in your hand as long as possible. Only drop it to the table when you can simultaneously pick up a card that completes your own suit.",
    Player: "Identify the 'Power Suits' on the table. If you see the Ace of Hearts on the table, immediately start collecting Hearts.\n\nThe 'Stop' Timing: Don't wait for 51. If you hit 45 or 48 early in the game, call 'Stop' immediately. Your opponents will likely have fragmented hands and won't be able to catch up in a single turn.\n\nMarket Manipulation: If you have a card that an opponent clearly needs (e.g., they are swapping for Spades and you hold the Spade King), keep it in your hand as long as possible. Only drop it to the table when you can simultaneously pick up a card that completes your own suit.",
